    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — Query Engine High-Cardinality Stress Test. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stress tests exercising the query engine parser, planner, and join executor under high-cardinality workloads (large query volumes, wide result sets, complex join graphs) and concurrent access. All tests use in-process stubs.</para>
<sect1 id="test__query__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md3_1s1"><sect2 id="test__query__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md3">
<title>Test cases</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HighCardinalityQueryParsing : 10 000 distinct query strings, 8 threads</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ConcurrentPlannerStress : 8 threads, each firing 1 000 plan requests</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ComplexJoinQueryStress : 500 complex join queries with 8-way fan-out</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
